@startuml SD-11 Node Heartbeat
title SD-11 Node Heartbeat

participant "ESP32 Node" as Node
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Node Status Handler" as Handler
database "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS
participant "Registration App" as RegApp
participant "Monitor App" as MonApp

Node -> MQTT: Publish heartbeat
MQTT -> Handler: Deliver heartbeat
Handler -> DB: Update last_ping_at and status ONLINE
DB --> Handler: Commit success
Handler -> WS: Broadcast node_heartbeat
WS -> RegApp: Update node status
WS -> MonApp: Update node status

@enduml